cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SAHC: a confidential data lake for multi-hospital analytics on Intel SGX"
message: "If you refer to this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Artur
    family-names: Correia
    affiliation: "Faculdade de Ciências, Universidade do Porto"
