  - given-names: Gonçalo
    family-names: Sousa
    affiliation: "Faculdade de Ciências, Universidade do Porto"
    email: up202509794@up.pt
  - given-names: Tiago
    family-names: Pinheiro
    affiliation: "Faculdade de Ciências, Universidade do Porto"
    email: up202207890@up.pt
abstract: >-
  A client/server system in which several hospitals upload encrypted
  patient records to an untrusted server and researchers run aggregate
  queries over the pooled dataset. Records are decrypted only inside an
  Intel SGX enclave. Built on the Intel SGX SDK and Gramine 1.9, with an
  embedded DuckDB query engine and real Intel DCAP remote attestation,
  validated on Intel SGX2 hardware.
keywords:
  - intel-sgx
  - confidential-computing
  - trusted-execution-environment
  - remote-attestation
  - dcap
  - gramine
license: MIT
